# Shell scripts run inside WSL/Linux (image build, media staging) and the
# systemd/firstboot files land on the Pi's rootfs: they MUST stay LF even
# when the repo is cloned on Windows with core.autocrlf=true — bash fails
# outright on CRLF. Python is LF for consistency.
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.pyx   text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text
